        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/c4cdca/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-17T18:09:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Nullpoint Callibration Unit reads \"When Absolute Zero would take Cold Damage, he regains that many HP instead.\" If he can't deal damage, he wouldn't take damage and he wouldn't heal. Hence, option #2 as noted above.</p>",
